da96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/Dolbeault.lean#L65-L83","doc":"**Cauchy–Riemann.** `∂̄f(z) = 0` iff `f` is complex-differentiable at `z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.Dolbeault.dz_dzbar_of_hasFDerivAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.Dolbeault.dz_dzbar_of_hasFDerivAt","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/Dolbeault.lean#L59-L63","doc":"The coefficients are determined by any real derivative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.Dolbeault.fderiv_eq_dz_add_dzbar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.Dolbeault.fderiv_eq_dz_add_dzbar","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/Dolbeault.lean#L54-L57","doc":"**The type decomposition of `df`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.Dolbeault.rlinear_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.Dolbeault.rlinear_eq","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/Dolbeault.lean#L41-L52","doc":"Every real-linear `ℂ → ℂ` is `v ↦ a v + b v̄`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.Dolbeault.dzbar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.Dolbeault.dzbar","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/Dolbeault.lean#L38-L39","doc":"`∂̄f(z) = (∂ₓf + i ∂ᵧf)/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.Dolbeault.dz","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.Dolbeault.dz","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/Dolbeault.lean#L35-L36","doc":"`∂f(z) = (∂ₓf − i ∂ᵧf)/2`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}